t.png\",\"portraitUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/minotaur/Hero193-portrait-20220525164734.webp\",\"splashUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/minotaur/Minotaur-Orbiter-20250626145953.webp\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Minotaur/Cosmetics\"},{\"name\":\"Sacred Hammer\",\"tier\":\"Common\",\"rawTier\":\"Common\",\"tag\":\"Elite\",\"tagSlug\":\"elite\",\"price\":\"599\",\"portraitFile\":\"Hero194-portrait.png\",\"portraitUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/minotaur/Hero194-portrait-20220525164735.webp\",\"splashUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/minotaur/Minotaur-Sacred-Hammer-20250626145913.webp\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Minotaur/Cosmetics\"},{\"name\":\"Taurus\",\"tier\":\"Deluxe\",\"rawTier\":\"Deluxe\",\"tag\":\"Zodiac\",\"tagSlug\":\"zodiac\",\"price\":\"Zodiac Summon\",\"portraitFile\":\"Hero195-portrait.png\",\"portraitUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/minotaur/Hero195-portrait-20230316133655.webp\",\"splashUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/minotaur/Minotaur-Taurus-20260919000527.webp\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Minotaur/Cosmetics\"},{\"name\":\"Dreadnought\",\"tier\":\"Exceptional\",\"rawTier\":\"Exceptional\",\"tag\":\"Special\",\"tagSlug\":\"special\",\"price\":\"Limited-time Event\",\"portraitFile\":\"Hero196-portrait.png\",\"portraitUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/minotaur/Hero196-portrait-20240114091540.webp\",\"splashUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/minotaur/Minotaur-Dreadnought-20250626145932.webp\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Minotaur/Cosmetics\"},{\"name\":\"Nether Overseer\",\"tier\":\"Deluxe\",\"rawTier\":\"Deluxe\",\"tag\":\"Epic\",\"tagSlug\":\"epic\",\"price\":\"899\",\"portraitFile\":\"Hero197-portrait.png\",\"portraitUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/minotaur/Hero197-portrait-20250619142554.webp\",\"splashUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/minotaur/Minotaur-Nether-Overseer-20250920020307.webp\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Minotaur/Cosmetics\"},{\"name\":\"Hammer of Despair\",\"tier\":\"Common\",\"rawTier\":\"Common\",\"tag\":\"Elite\",\"tagSlug\":\"elite\",\"price\":\"2020/03 StarLight Reward\",\"portraitFile\":\"Hero194-portrait.png\",\"portraitUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/minotaur/Hero194-portrait-20220525164735.webp\",\"splashUrl\":null,\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Minotaur/Cosmetics\"}],\"lore\":{\"backstory\":\"Minotaur is the Son of Minos, a gentle and scholarly creature descended from the legendary bull-men of an ancient labyrinth civilization. Unlike his fearsome ancestors, Minotaur devoted himself to the healing arts, studying sacred chants that mend wounds and restore vitality to his allies. However, when pushed to his breaking point by injustice or cruelty, a primal rage awakens within him, transforming his gentle chants into devastating war cries that stun and scatter all nearby enemies. Minotaur's dual nature (compassionate healer and raging berserker) makes him a uniquely unpredictable guardian, feared by enemies who make the grave mistake of provoking his wrath.\",\"allies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"estes\",\"heroName\":\"Estes\",\"relationship\":\"Moon Elf King and fellow devoted healer on the front lines\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"rafaela\",\"heroName\":\"Rafaela\",\"relationship\":\"Celestial angel who shares his calling to mend and protect\"}],\"rivals\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"franco\",\"heroName\":\"Franco\",\"relationship\":\"Northern chieftain whose hook drags him from his allies\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"atlas\",\"heroName\":\"Atlas\",\"relationship\":\"Ocean titan whose suppression silences his healing chants\"}]},\"loreUrlName\":\"$undefined\",\"statsHistory\":[{\"date\":\"2026-09-07\",\"winRate\":54.42,\"pickRate\":0.83,\"banRate\":4.85},{\"date\":